    title: "fix(rstatus): count NEWS entries under subsection headers"
    state: RELEASED v2.20.1
    summary: |
      parse_news_header ended the top NEWS.md section at the first header of any level, so
      R-convention files (`# pkg 0.4.0` then `## New features`, e.g. medfit 0.4.0) reported 0
      entries in /rforge:restore. Now ends at the next header of same-or-higher level, or at a
      deeper header naming a release (so a `# Changelog` wrapper doesn't merge the whole
      history). +tests, docs/reference/rstatus.md, CHANGELOG [Unreleased] Fixed entry.
